  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Alteration sphere, Nature sphere (any (spirit) talent).</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you use shapeshift on a creature, you may also imbue the target with a non-instantaneous spirit ability. You must spend spell points as normal if required by the spirit ability, and when you apply a (spirit) talent to a target in this way, it counts against the number of traits you may grant with your shapeshift.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/alteration#toc95\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
